        "message" : "<p>Hello %FIRST_NAME% %LAST_NAME%,</p>\n<p>Please use the following one-time password to reset your %APP_NAME% password.</p>\n<p>%OTP_VALIDITY_TEXT%</p>\n<p style=\"font-size: larger;\"><b>%OTP%</b></p>\n<p>If you didn’t ask to reset your password, you can ignore this email.</p>\n<p>Thanks,</p>\n<p>Your %APP_NAME% team</p>"
      },
